    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, this card's [When Digivolving] effect doesn't allow ignoring color requirements, so you can only use cards that meet the color requirements.",
        "question": "Can I ignore the color requirements when I use this card's [When Digivolving] effect in order to use an Option card with [Plug-In] or a yellow Option card?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, as long as the Option card you use has a cost of 2 or more, this card's [Your Turn] effect activates regardless of the actual cost paid.",
        "question": "If I activate an effect that reduces the cost of an Option card with a cost of 2 or more and I only pay a cost of 1, or if I do not pay the cost at all by activating an effect that allows me to use an Option card without paying the cost, does this card's [Your Turn] effect activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it doesn’t activate.  It doesn't activate if the cost of an Option card consistently changes when it's in the hand and becomes 1 or less due to that card's effect.",
